msgid "Grain size"
msgstr "Gren boyutu"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:84
msgid "Set how coarse the film grain is."
msgstr "Film greninin ne kadar iri taneli olacağını ayarla."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:88
msgid "Also on the phone"
msgstr "Telefonda da var"

