msgid "The Camera card has the phone's own Sharpening and Noise reduction. Using both looks worse."
msgstr "Kamera kartında telefonun kendi Keskinleştirme ve Gürültü azaltma ayarları vardır. İkisini birden kullanmak daha kötü görünür."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:368 rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:476 rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:539 rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:539 rust/crates/effects/src/filters.rs:552 rust/crates/effects/ui/filters.slint:38
